[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6129.27, "timestamp": "01:42:09", "text": "所以，我們就把這筆交易敲定下來。好的。我點選確定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6131.43, "timestamp": "01:42:11", "text": "好的。呃，我不會完成那件事。  這將是一門全能型課程。我可以使用武器，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6133.03, "timestamp": "01:42:13", "text": "嗯，是的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6138.709, "timestamp": "01:42:18", "text": "你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6141.91, "timestamp": "01:42:21", "text": "可以使用武器。嗯，好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6143.91, "timestamp": "01:42:23", "text": "所以這將決定你以後的遊戲風格。這是你的原始秩序。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6146.07, "timestamp": "01:42:26", "text": "你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6147.109, "timestamp": "01:42:27", "text": "想成為魔術師、魔法師還是獄卒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6150.47, "timestamp": "01:42:30", "text": "？魔術師。魔法師"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6155.43, "timestamp": "01:42:35", "text": "意味著你可以掌握更多魔法，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6159.91, "timestamp": "01:42:39", "text": "而且水系魔法意味著你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6163.51, "timestamp": "01:42:43", "text": "可以使用更高級的武器，以及更堅固的中型盔甲，因為目前你只能使用輕型盔甲"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6164.55, "timestamp": "01:42:44", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6167.91, "timestamp": "01:42:47", "text": "等等，為什麼沒有弓箭手和其他職業？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6170.79, "timestamp": "01:42:50", "text": "你說什麼？  為什麼這裡沒有弓箭手和其他物品？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6177.43, "timestamp": "01:42:57", "text": "哦，不。這就好比"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6178.39, "timestamp": "01:42:58", "text": "你想用弓箭，你"}]